1
00:00:16,181 --> 00:00:18,852
It's not easy to get out
early and do the cleaning.

2
00:00:19,352 --> 00:00:20,352
But!

3
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,147
I've got to tough it out.

4
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:28,570
What are you doing here?

5
00:00:32,698 --> 00:00:34,117
How did you...

6
00:00:38,204 --> 00:00:39,204
Is this training?

7
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:40,832
What the hell are you doing?

8
00:00:41,833 --> 00:00:42,833
Who made you do this?

9
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:44,251
The couch?

10
00:00:44,461 --> 00:00:45,461
Or the Principal?

11
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,005
The Principal promised

12
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,758
to give us support
if I clean bathrooms.

13
00:00:49,841 --> 00:00:51,411
He'll support us
only if you do this?

14
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:52,343
Hey.

15
00:00:52,677 --> 00:00:53,636
Don't do this anymore.

16
00:00:53,636 --> 00:00:55,055
I told to him I will!

17
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:56,055
Are you crazy?

18
00:00:56,389 --> 00:00:58,266
Not your responsibility
to do school's chores.

19
00:00:58,266 --> 00:00:59,809
Then what should we do?

20
00:00:59,809 --> 00:01:01,561
Our gloves are all torn off

21
00:01:01,561 --> 00:01:02,812
we can't catch balls right

22
00:01:03,063 --> 00:01:04,855
and all the bats were broken!

23
00:01:04,855 --> 00:01:06,775
Someone had to step up.

24
00:01:06,775 --> 00:01:08,193
Why should it be you?

25
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:10,111
Because I'm the captain!

26
00:01:12,864 --> 00:01:14,032
I'm the captain.

27
00:01:14,908 --> 00:01:16,055
So I must make sacrifices.

28
00:01:16,201 --> 00:01:17,921
No one is going to
like a captain like that.

29
00:01:18,703 --> 00:01:19,703
Do what you want.
